    "text": "The curve satisfying the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;(where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is the constant of integration) is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></math>.&nbsp;Then, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
